{"4001060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Asteria: Fate of the Fallen", "steam_appid": 4001060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asteria: Fate of the Fallen is an anime-style, virtual reality MMORPG that aims to bring a large, immersive world to PCVR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001060/extras/afdd852062d4affb9cee5d26980986b3.poster.avif?t=1776211859\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001060/extras/afdd852062d4affb9cee5d26980986b3.webm?t=1776211859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001060/extras/afdd852062d4affb9cee5d26980986b3.mp4?t=1776211859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the story of 'The Fallen' as you explore the world of Asteria and take part in one of many independent core gameplay loops, including but not limited to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blacksmithing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001060/extras/0ba55c23f000b480e2eed5f5fbe9718b.poster.avif?t=1776211859\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001060/extras/0ba55c23f000b480e2eed5f5fbe9718b.webm?t=1776211859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001060/extras/0ba55c23f000b480e2eed5f5fbe9718b.mp4?t=1776211859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and become a part of Selara, Asteria's main player city, where you'll be able to trade, hang out with friends, own and run shops, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001060/extras/3d3fc7d3fa5c6cc9a0da29fdc7e4d4bc.poster.avif?t=1776211859\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001060/extras/3d3fc7d3fa5c6cc9a0da29fdc7e4d4bc.webm?t=1776211859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001060/extras/3d3fc7d3fa5c6cc9a0da29fdc7e4d4bc.mp4?t=1776211859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asteria: Fate of the Fallen is an anime-style, virtual reality MMORPG that aims to bring a large, immersive world to PCVR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001060/extras/afdd852062d4affb9cee5d26980986b3.poster.avif?t=1776211859\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001060/extras/afdd852062d4affb9cee5d26980986b3.webm?t=1776211859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001060/extras/afdd852062d4affb9cee5d26980986b3.mp4?t=1776211859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the story of 'The Fallen' as you explore the world of Asteria and take part in one of many independent core gameplay loops, including but not limited to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blacksmithing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001060/extras/0ba55c23f000b480e2eed5f5fbe9718b.poster.avif?t=1776211859\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001060/extras/0ba55c23f000b480e2eed5f5fbe9718b.webm?t=1776211859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001060/extras/0ba55c23f000b480e2eed5f5fbe9718b.mp4?t=1776211859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and become a part of Selara, Asteria's main player city, where you'll be able to trade, hang out with friends, own and run shops, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001060/extras/3d3fc7d3fa5c6cc9a0da29fdc7e4d4bc.poster.avif?t=1776211859\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001060/extras/3d3fc7d3fa5c6cc9a0da29fdc7e4d4bc.webm?t=1776211859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001060/extras/3d3fc7d3fa5c6cc9a0da29fdc7e4d4bc.mp4?t=1776211859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Asteria: Fat